  "details": "Click to Pick up object and drop is too raw to allow expansion, like it was implemented and said \"good enough\". It is holding back potential and needs to be re-done for action\n\nWorlds with flying vehicles and stick based vehicles suffer due to the \"align with position\" preventing the vehicle from returning to a neutral state or making it difficult to click and object while object is moving\n\nAn example would be expanding animations to \"race wheel\" or \"push to access\", to allow expanded interaction rather than the limiting system that has been in the game from the beginning",
